sequenceDiagram
 participant B as Browser
 participant API as Express / Better Auth
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 B->>API: sign up or sign in credentials
 API->>DB: read/write user, account and session
 DB-->>API: persisted result
 API-->>B: response and session cookie
 B->>API: protected request with cookie
 API->>DB: getSessionFromHeaders lookup
 DB-->>API: user/session or none
 API-->>B: route response or 401
 B->>API: sign out
 API->>DB: invalidate session
 API-->>B: result / clear cookie
